C('Hanoi Phenikaa-X sandbox','category','pilot (controlled sandbox)','Hanoi authorities have authorized Phenikaa-X JSC, a local autonomous technology developer, to conduct a 24-month controlled trial of a smart autonomous transportation system, including autonomous buses, robotaxis, automated cleaning robots, and delivery robots.','S08-hanoi','B','normalized','vna-hanoi-decision')
